        {
          "text": "Tolimok Yosep talokaatokeng tama, “Edikino tokona ayong atoani. Nakaneni ebuni Akuj ni iyakasi esi kipudo kane kiyaa nakwap nakolong echikakini Aburaam, ka Isaka, ta Yakobo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
